{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超在一個有關可持續發展的論壇視像致辭。他表示，香港有優勢在連繫綠色資本、創新與治理之間作出重要貢獻。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n生態環境部部長黃潤秋就說，各界必須加強團結協作，推動綠色發展。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:19.219417+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:37:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:38:41.778615+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:40.704858+00:00","content_hash":"2e1f35b922c72d25565f30f565746eb6b87fb586d66400be398a6005f9e79cb0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}